 "stmt_deps": [],
 "proof": [
  {
   "text": "At a point outside $V(\\mathcal I)$, the stalk $\\mathcal I_x$ is not\ncontained in the maximal ideal of $\\mathcal O_{X,x}$, so it contains a unit\nand equals $\\mathcal O_{X,x}$. Equality of quasi-coherent ideals can be\nchecked on stalks.",
